{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":75,"name":null,"username":"boblee","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.mulerun.com/boblee/{size}/25_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-05T06:37:12.856Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI understand MuleRun is an agent platform, but how do creators actually make money here? Do users pay per use, or is it subscription‑based? Are there any examples of agents that are already earning? Besides listing an agent, is there anything else I should do to increase my chances of getting paid?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurious what the real earning paths look like.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T06:37:12.856Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":100,"reads":21,"readers_count":20,"score":494.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":45,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":null,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://community.mulerun.com/t/topic/69","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Your Path to Building \u0026 Earning on MuleRun","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":14,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/45/1","can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":78,"name":null,"username":"TinyFox","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.mulerun.com/tinyfox/{size}/12_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-05T08:56:28.441Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eOn MuleRun there are several ways to earn:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMonetize your agents directly: \u003ca href=\"https://mulerun.com/docs/creator-guide/creator-studio/billing-methods\"\u003eYou can set your own pricing\u003c/a\u003e. Whenever users pay to use your agent, you receive the revenue after the platform fee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin creator incentive programs: \u003ca href=\"https://community.mulerun.com/t/topic/27\"\u003eEvery month we run extra incentive campaigns\u003c/a\u003e. These give you additional cash on top of your normal earnings when you hit certain milestones or participate in special events.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd we already have many creators earning on MuleRun. \u003ca href=\"https://ai.feishu.cn/wiki/CHd9w4BfLiTruikVIsAc3XmbnPx\"\u003eMost existing showcases are currently in Chinese\u003c/a\u003e, but creators are actively working on English versions and they will publish those in \u003ca href=\"https://community.mulerun.com/t/topic/27\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eMuleRun Creator Incentives (2025/12)\u003c/a\u003e — stay tuned!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo increase your earning potential, we recommend:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFocusing on a clear, painful problem for a specific user group.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdding a short demo video so people instantly understand your agent. Writing a strong description (what it does, who it’s for, and concrete outcomes).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSharing your agent in the right communities and with your existing audience.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you tell us your skills and domain , we’d be happy to help brainstorm monetizable agent ideas with you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T08:56:28.441Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":23.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":45,"topic_slug":